{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45450","headline":"送造微上人游五台及礼本师 · 栖白","name":"送造微上人游五台及礼本师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒空金锡响，欲过渭阳津。\n极目多来鴈，孤城少故人。\n与师虽别久，於法本相亲。\n又对清凉月，中宵语宿因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}